1
00:00:02,70 --> 00:00:04,53
Who the winny-binny boy?
我的小不點兒

2
00:00:05,40 --> 00:00:09,53
You the winny-winny-binny-binny boy!
你是個小小的小不點兒

3
00:00:11,21 --> 00:00:13,23
Don't cry.
不要哭啊

4
00:00:13,44 --> 00:00:15,53
Don't cry.
不要哭嘛

5
00:00:17,25 --> 00:00:19,58
Why is he still crying?
他為什麼還在哭？

6
00:00:19,81 --> 00:00:21,87
Let me hold him for a sec.
我來抱他一下

7
00:00:22,08 --> 00:00:23,45
Here we go.
來，爸爸抱

8
00:00:24,79 --> 00:00:25,65
There we are.
不哭了

9
00:00:27,49 --> 00:00:28,62
Maybe it's me.
或許是因為我

10
00:00:28,96 --> 00:00:32,83
Don't be silly. Ben loves you. He's just being Mr. Cranky Pants.
別傻了，班愛你 他只是愛發牢騷而已

11
00:00:33,13 --> 00:00:35,76
You know,I once dated a Miss Cranky Pants.
我跟一個牢騷小姐約過會呀

12
00:00:36,97 --> 00:00:39,49
Lovely girl. IKind of moody.
好女孩，有點情緒化就是了

13
00:00:40,34 --> 00:00:42,13
There we go,all better.
好了，好多了

14
00:00:42,74 --> 00:00:44,73
There's my little boy.
這才是小乖乖

15
00:00:51,18 --> 00:00:53,48
Can I see something?
我可以試一件事嗎？

16
00:01:07,26 --> 00:01:08,16
Cool!
酷哎

17
00:01:08,36 --> 00:01:10,89
He hates me. My nephew hates me!
他恨我，我的姪子恨我

18
00:01:11,10 --> 00:01:12,36
Come on,don't do this.
好啦，不要這樣嘛

19
00:01:12,60 --> 00:01:15,30
What if my own baby hates me? What do I do then?
要是我自己孩子恨我 怎麼辦啊？

20
00:01:15,50 --> 00:01:17,03
Monica,stop! This is nuts.
摩妮卡，你住口好不好？ 你瘋了是不是啊？

21
00:01:17,34 --> 00:01:21,27
Do you know how long it'll be before you have to deal with this?
你知道你還要多久 才會遇到這個問題呢？

22
00:01:22,14 --> 00:01:24,77
You don't even have a boyfriend yet.
我是說你現在連男朋友都沒有

23
00:01:27,12 --> 00:01:29,35
Joey,she does not look fat.
喬伊，她看起來不胖

24
00:01:30,55 --> 00:01:32,61
The One With the Baby on the Bus
<font color=#38B0DE>-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 河馬壓縮製作 本字幕為河馬根據R3DVD OCR得來</font>

25
00:01:38,82 --> 00:01:45,82
六人行 第2季 第06集 寶寶落在巴士上了

26
00:02:16,90 --> 00:02:18,33
Here you go.
拿去

27
00:02:22,87 --> 00:02:24,74
Goo,goo,goo!
咕，咕，咕！

28
00:02:27,94 --> 00:02:30,84
That is so funny! Let me see that a sec.
真好笑，那個借我一下

29
00:02:38,45 --> 00:02:39,28
You okay?
你還好吧，羅斯？

30
00:02:39,52 --> 00:02:40,78
I don't know.
不知道

31
00:02:42,96 --> 00:02:44,52
What's in this pie?
餡餅裡有什麼呀？

32
00:02:44,73 --> 00:02:48,42
I don't know. Butter and eggs and flour and lime and kiwi
不知道，奶油，雞蛋，麵粉 萊姆，奇異果跟…

33
00:02:48,63 --> 00:02:50,79
Kiwi? Kiwi?!
奇異果？奇異果？

34
00:02:51,53 --> 00:02:52,97
You said it was a key lime pie.
你說這個是奇萊餡餅

35
00:02:53,20 --> 00:02:57,10
No,I didn't. I said kiwi lime. That's what makes it so special.
不是，我是說奇異果萊姆 所以才會那麼特別

36
00:02:57,37 --> 00:02:59,36
That's what's gonna kill me.
所以我才會死

37
00:03:01,31 --> 00:03:02,64
I'm allergic to kiwi.
我對奇異果過敏

38
00:03:03,21 --> 00:03:06,87
No,you're not. You're allergic to lobster and peanuts and
你才不會呢 你會過敏的是龍蝦，花生跟…

39
00:03:09,12 --> 00:03:10,38
Oh,my God!
天啊

40
00:03:10,59 --> 00:03:12,38
It's definitely getting worse.
越來越嚴重了

41
00:03:13,22 --> 00:03:14,81
Is your tongue swelling up?
你的舌頭腫了嗎？

42
00:03:15,29 --> 00:03:17,92
Either that or my mouth is getting smaller!
要不然就是我的嘴小了

43
00:03:18,73 --> 00:03:20,92
Get your coat. We're going to the hospital.
穿外套，我們現在就到醫院去

44
00:03:21,13 --> 00:03:23,39
-Will he be okay? -He's gotta get a shot.
他不會怎麼樣吧？ 不會，只是得打一針

45
00:03:23,60 --> 00:03:26,97
You know,actually, it's getting better. It is.
事實上我覺得好多了

46
00:03:27,17 --> 00:03:29,57
Let's not go. Anyone up for Scrabble?
沒錯，別去了 誰要玩拼字遊戲啊？

47
00:03:30,74 --> 00:03:32,50
Jacket,now!
去穿外套

48
00:03:32,94 --> 00:03:36,17
What about Ben? We can't bring a baby to the hospital.
但是班怎麼辦呢？ 我們不能帶個寶寶去醫院啊

49
00:03:36,98 --> 00:03:38,61
We'll watch him.
交給我們吧

50
00:03:38,98 --> 00:03:40,50
I don't think so.
恕難從命

51
00:03:41,78 --> 00:03:46,08
I have seven Catholic sisters. I've taken care of hundreds of kids.
幹嘛？我有七個天主教姐妹 我照顧過上百個小孩

52
00:03:46,59 --> 00:03:48,52
Come on,we want to do it. Don't we?
別這樣 我們想幫忙，對不對？

53
00:03:48,76 --> 00:03:50,85
I was gonna play basketball...
拜託，我本來想去打籃球的…

54
00:03:51,09 --> 00:03:52,99
... but I guess that's out the window.
…不過球被丟出窗外去了

55
00:03:54,20 --> 00:03:57,29
If you take him out for a walk, remember to bring his hat.
好，如果你要帶他去散步 記得要幫他戴帽子，好嗎？

56
00:03:57,50 --> 00:04:00,30
There's milk in the refrigerator and diapers in the bag.
冰箱裡還有一些牛奶 尿布在袋子裡

57
00:04:00,54 --> 00:04:01,97
Hat,milk....
帽子，牛奶…

58
00:04:02,17 --> 00:04:03,00
Got it!
懂了

59
00:04:12,55 --> 00:04:13,95
Consider it done!
包在我身上啊

60
00:04:14,45 --> 00:04:15,28
You understood?
你聽得懂嗎？

61
00:04:15,52 --> 00:04:18,38
My uncle Sal has a really big tongue.
懂啊，我沙叔叔就有大舌頭

62
00:04:20,36 --> 00:04:22,55
Is he the one with the beautiful wife?
他是老婆很正的那個

63
00:04:26,39 --> 00:04:27,95
中央公園

64
00:04:28,70 --> 00:04:32,13
You want to hear the song I'm singing this afternoon?
阿秋，要不要聽聽 我今天下午要唱的新歌呢？

65
00:04:32,37 --> 00:04:34,89
I wrote it this morning in the shower.
今天早上洗澡的時候寫的

66
00:04:37,21 --> 00:04:41,67
I'm in the shower And I'm writing a song
我一邊洗澡一邊在寫歌

67
00:04:42,24 --> 00:04:45,97
Stop me if you've heard it
聽過的話請阻止我

68
00:04:48,35 --> 00:04:52,15
My skin is soapy and my hair is wet
我全身泡沫，頭髮濕搭搭

69
00:04:52,39 --> 00:04:56,55
And Tegrin spelled backward is nirget
香皂倒過來是皂香

70
00:05:00,36 --> 00:05:04,49
Rachel,sweetheart, could I see you for a minute?
瑞秋，親愛的 麻煩你過來一下好嗎？

71
00:05:08,27 --> 00:05:09,50
What's up?
什麼事啊？

72
00:05:10,07 --> 00:05:11,77
FYK:
告訴你…

73
00:05:12,04 --> 00:05:16,24
I've decided to pay a professional musician to play here on Sundays.
我決定以後週日的下午 要付錢請一位職業歌手來演出

74
00:05:16,44 --> 00:05:20,57
Her name is Stephanie something. She's supposed to be very good.
她叫什麼芬妮的，很出色的

75
00:05:20,78 --> 00:05:22,84
But what about Phoebe?
但菲比怎麼辦？

76
00:05:23,79 --> 00:05:26,58
It's not that your friend is bad.
瑞秋，你的朋友不是差而已

77
00:05:27,42 --> 00:05:29,52
It's that she's so bad...
她實在是差到…

78
00:05:31,09 --> 00:05:35,79
...she makes me want to put my finger through my eye into my brain...
差到讓我想把手指頭 伸進我的眼睛裡

79
00:05:36,03 --> 00:05:37,69
...and swirl it around.
然後把腦袋攪成漿糊

80
00:05:39,77 --> 00:05:42,20
Okay,so you're not a fan.
那好，你不是她的歌迷

81
00:05:43,04 --> 00:05:45,97
But,I mean,come on. You cannot do this to her.
可是你不能這樣對她嘛

82
00:05:49,98 --> 00:05:51,47
I have to do this to her?
你叫我出面？

83
00:05:51,75 --> 00:05:53,81
Lather,rinse,repeat
塗皂，沖水，再一次…

84
00:05:54,05 --> 00:05:56,24
And lather,rinse,repeat
塗皂，沖水，再一次…

85
00:05:56,45 --> 00:05:59,94
And lather,rinse,repeat
塗皂，沖水，再一次…

86
00:06:00,15 --> 00:06:01,88
As needed
視需要而定

87
00:06:08,60 --> 00:06:10,22
We didn't bring enough stuff.
我覺得我們東西沒有帶夠

88
00:06:10,43 --> 00:06:12,96
Did you forget to pack the baby's anvil?
你有沒有記得 把寶寶的止痛藥帶出來？

89
00:06:13,17 --> 00:06:15,07
I'm telling you,it'll be worth it.
我告訴你，這絕對值得

90
00:06:15,67 --> 00:06:18,14
It's a known fact that women love babies.
大家都知道女人最愛寶寶了

91
00:06:18,34 --> 00:06:22,00
Women love guys who love babies. It's the sensitive thing.
女人愛喜歡寶寶的男人 這是感性的問題，懂了嗎？

92
00:06:23,01 --> 00:06:26,84
Aim him at that pack of babes. Maybe one of them will break away.
把他對準那邊那些寶貝 說不定待會兒有一個會過來

93
00:06:27,52 --> 00:06:30,81
Wait,forget them. We got one. Hard left.
不…等一下 算了，正左方

94
00:06:31,09 --> 00:06:32,92
-Give me the baby. -No,I got him.
來，寶寶給我 不要，我要抱

95
00:06:33,15 --> 00:06:34,31
Come on,seriously.
快，我說真的

96
00:06:34,52 --> 00:06:36,46
Oh,seriously,you want him?
你真的要他嗎？

97
00:06:41,13 --> 00:06:42,69
Who is this little cutie-pie?
這個小可愛是誰啊？

98
00:06:43,16 --> 00:06:45,83
Well,don't think me immodest,but...
不要怪我不懂得謙虛，但…

99
00:06:46,03 --> 00:06:47,50
... me.
…我

100
00:06:48,94 --> 00:06:49,87
Want to smell him?
要不要嗅嗅他？

101
00:06:50,10 --> 00:06:52,20
I assume we're talking about the baby?
我想你指的是寶寶吧？

102
00:06:54,88 --> 00:06:58,18
He's got that great baby smell. Get a whiff of his head.
是呀，他的寶寶味好香 嗅嗅他的頭

103
00:07:00,45 --> 00:07:02,28
My uterus just skipped a beat.
我想我的子宮剛剛頓了一下

104
00:07:03,52 --> 00:07:04,68
What'd I tell you?
你看吧

105
00:07:04,95 --> 00:07:06,44
It's great you're doing this.
我覺得你們這樣做很棒

106
00:07:06,85 --> 00:07:08,82
Well,we are great guys.
我們都是很棒的男人

107
00:07:09,06 --> 00:07:12,15
My brother and his boyfriend have been trying to adopt.
我弟弟跟他的男友 試了三年都領養不到孩子

108
00:07:12,39 --> 00:07:14,83
What agency did you two go through?
你們是找哪一家辦的？

109
00:07:19,47 --> 00:07:21,03
But this is my gig.
這是我的表演

110
00:07:21,24 --> 00:07:22,70
This is where I play.
這是我的地盤

111
00:07:22,90 --> 00:07:25,40
My name is written out there in chalk.
我的名字用粉筆寫在外面

112
00:07:25,64 --> 00:07:28,37
You know,you can't just erase chalk.
你不能把粉筆擦掉的

113
00:07:31,81 --> 00:07:32,97
Honey,I'm sorry.
對不起，我很遺憾

114
00:07:33,25 --> 00:07:35,51
And he's going to be paying this woman?
而且他居然還要付這個女人錢

115
00:07:35,72 --> 00:07:38,58
Why doesn't he just give her a throne and a crown?
那他乾脆給她一個寶座 一頂皇冠

116
00:07:38,85 --> 00:07:43,79
And,like,a gold stick with a ball on top?
還有一根上面有球的權杖

117
00:07:44,66 --> 00:07:48,22
Terry is a jerk! That's why we always say,"Terry's a jerk!"
泰利是混蛋，所以我們才會 常說「泰利是混蛋」

118
00:07:48,50 --> 00:07:50,90
That's where that came from.
不然我們幹嘛那麼說

119
00:07:53,67 --> 00:07:56,16
You probably did everything you could.
你說不定已經盡力了

120
00:07:57,41 --> 00:08:01,36
You know what? Let me just see what else I could do.
好吧，這樣讓我看看 還有沒有別的辦法

121
00:08:04,21 --> 00:08:07,18
Just let her go on after Stephanie whatever her name is.
你何不讓她接在 那個叫黛什麼芬的後面唱啊？

122
00:08:07,42 --> 00:08:09,75
You won't be here. You don't pay her.
你又不在這裡，又不付她錢

123
00:08:10,35 --> 00:08:11,61
I don't know.
我不知道

124
00:08:11,85 --> 00:08:13,72
I'll clean the cappuccino machine!
我幫你洗卡布基諾機好了

125
00:08:13,92 --> 00:08:16,29
You don't clean the cappuccino machine?
你不洗卡布基諾機嗎？

126
00:08:17,93 --> 00:08:20,72
Of course I clean it.
我當然會

127
00:08:20,96 --> 00:08:23,69
I mean,I will clean it.
我是說我會清洗

128
00:08:23,90 --> 00:08:25,46
I mean,I will clean it.
我會清的

129
00:08:25,70 --> 00:08:28,60
All right,fine,fine,fine!
好…

130
00:08:33,61 --> 00:08:34,97
-Done. -Really?
成了 真的？

131
00:08:35,21 --> 00:08:36,73
Who's working for you,babe?
對呀，看誰出馬嘛

132
00:08:37,45 --> 00:08:42,08
Oh,my God! This is so exciting! How much am I gonna get?
天啊，好興奮哦 我會收到多少錢啊？

133
00:08:42,28 --> 00:08:43,31
What?
什麼？

134
00:08:44,09 --> 00:08:46,38
He's paying the people who were playing.
你說他要付錢給演出的人

135
00:08:47,42 --> 00:08:52,32
I meant,he's paying that other woman because she's a professional.
我是說他要付另外那個女人錢 因為她是職業歌手

136
00:08:52,79 --> 00:08:55,73
I'm not gonna be the only one who's not getting paid.
我可不想當那個 唯一沒有收到錢的人

137
00:08:57,43 --> 00:08:58,73
I'm sorry,no!
對不起，不

138
00:08:59,13 --> 00:09:03,47
No,I'm not some sloppy second, you know,charity band.
不，我可不是什麼二流的… 慈善樂團

139
00:09:03,67 --> 00:09:06,16
There are thousands of places in this city...
這個城市裡面有上千個地方…

140
00:09:06,44 --> 00:09:09,14
...where people would pay to hear me play.
…願意付錢聽我來演唱

141
00:09:09,34 --> 00:09:11,28
When I play,I play for me
我為自己而演唱

142
00:09:11,48 --> 00:09:13,50
I don't need your charity
我不需要你的施捨

143
00:09:13,75 --> 00:09:15,18
Thank you!
謝謝

144
00:09:23,36 --> 00:09:26,69
I'm not getting a shot. Maybe they can take the needle...
你說什麼都別想叫我打針 我是說，或許他們可以把…

145
00:09:26,93 --> 00:09:30,59
...and squirt it into my mouth. Like a squirt gun.
…藥水射進我的嘴裡 就像水槍那樣

146
00:09:31,20 --> 00:09:33,50
Hello there. I'm Dr. Carlin.
你們好，我是林醫生

147
00:09:34,00 --> 00:09:37,66
I see someone's having a little allergic reaction.
好像有人有一點點過敏的反應

148
00:09:37,94 --> 00:09:40,37
Doctor,can I see you for just a moment?
對，醫生 我可以單獨跟你談談嗎？

149
00:09:42,51 --> 00:09:46,28
My brother has a slight phobia about needles.
我哥哥有一點點害怕打針

150
00:09:46,51 --> 00:09:49,35
Did you tell him about my squirt gun idea?
你有沒有告訴他 我那個水槍的主意？

151
00:09:50,99 --> 00:09:53,35
My brother,the Ph.D., would like to know...
我的博士哥哥想知道…

152
00:09:53,55 --> 00:09:56,22
...if there's any way to treat this orally?
這個藥有沒有可能用口服的？

153
00:09:57,02 --> 00:10:01,32
Under these circumstances,it has to be an injection,and it has to be now.
在這種情況之下，打針是 避免不了的，而且要馬上打針

154
00:10:02,33 --> 00:10:03,52
So?
怎麼樣？

155
00:10:06,13 --> 00:10:09,86
Go and have a seat. The doctor says it's got to be a needle.
好吧，坐下來 醫生說這一針非打不可

156
00:10:10,07 --> 00:10:14,84
You're just going to have to be brave. Can you do that for me?
所以你一定要勇敢起來 為我這麼做，好不好？

157
00:10:17,91 --> 00:10:20,88
Oh,boy! You are doing so good.
你做得非常好

158
00:10:22,65 --> 00:10:24,58
You want to squeeze my hand?
要不要握緊我的手啊？

159
00:10:25,52 --> 00:10:27,54
Ross,don't squeeze it so hard.
羅斯，不要握得那麼緊

160
00:10:27,76 --> 00:10:30,28
Honey,really. Don't squeeze it so hard!
真的，不要握那麼緊

161
00:10:30,49 --> 00:10:32,25
Let go of my hand!
羅斯，放開我的手

162
00:10:35,86 --> 00:10:38,35
Good plan. Next time we want to pick up women...
還真是個好計劃 下一回想泡妞…

163
00:10:38,60 --> 00:10:41,07
...we should go to the park and make out.
…我們乾脆直接去公園 親熱算了

164
00:10:41,57 --> 00:10:43,09
Taxi! Taxi!
計程車…

165
00:10:45,34 --> 00:10:46,60
Look at that talent.
你看那票妞兒

166
00:10:50,04 --> 00:10:52,10
Just practicing. You're good.
只是在練習，你很行

167
00:10:52,35 --> 00:10:53,57
Carry on.
繼續開吧

168
00:10:54,28 --> 00:10:55,87
Wait,wait,wait!
等等，等等我們

169
00:10:56,52 --> 00:10:59,68
Hey,you. He's just adorable.
他好可愛哦

170
00:10:59,89 --> 00:11:04,12
Can you tell him that? Because he thinks he looks too pink.
告訴他，好不好？ 他覺得他臉色太紅潤了

171
00:11:05,69 --> 00:11:09,06
-What are you guys out doing today? -We're not out.
你們今天出來做什麼？ 我們沒有

172
00:11:10,70 --> 00:11:13,63
We're two heterosexual guys hanging with the son...
我們只是幫我們的 異性戀朋友…

173
00:11:13,87 --> 00:11:18,40
...of our other heterosexual friend, doing the usual straight-guy stuff.
…帶孩子的異性戀男人 做一般男人應該做的事情

174
00:11:19,47 --> 00:11:20,70
You done?
講完了？

175
00:11:21,91 --> 00:11:22,93
There's our stop.
我們到了

176
