Get out of here! This is our stop.
少來了，我們才到了

177
00:11:26,55 --> 00:11:28,41
You guys live around here too?
你們也住在這附近啊？

178
00:11:28,75 --> 00:11:31,55
We live in the building by the sidewalk.
我們住在那個人行道旁邊

179
00:11:33,89 --> 00:11:35,29
You know it?
你們知道嗎？

180
00:11:36,59 --> 00:11:40,65
Since we're neighbors,what do you say we get together for a drink?
對了，既然大家是鄰居嘛 我們聚一聚喝點東西，如何？

181
00:11:45,60 --> 00:11:47,79
So you want to go to Markel's?
我們去馬可咖啡廳，好嗎？

182
00:11:48,74 --> 00:11:50,26
Sure,they love us over there.
好啊，他們很喜歡我們

183
00:11:50,91 --> 00:11:52,17
Where's your baby?
你們的寶寶呢？

184
00:12:03,18 --> 00:12:05,31
Ben! Ben!
班…

185
00:12:05,79 --> 00:12:09,24
That's good. Maybe he'll hear you and pull the cord!
或許他會聽到拉鈴啊

186
00:12:09,49 --> 00:12:10,96
Stop the bus!
停車

187
00:12:19,77 --> 00:12:22,17
Are you sure he didn't break it? It hurts.
你肯定沒有捏斷？我真的很痛

188
00:12:22,37 --> 00:12:25,53
No,it's just a good bone bruise.
沒有，只是有一塊瘀青

189
00:12:26,44 --> 00:12:30,31
And right here is the puncture wound from your ring.
還有這是你戒指壓出來的痕跡

190
00:12:31,35 --> 00:12:34,01
-I'm really sorry. -It's okay.
對不起，我真的很抱歉 沒關係

191
00:12:34,22 --> 00:12:35,51
Sorry.
抱歉…

192
00:12:36,02 --> 00:12:39,47
Sorry! I got my S's back!
抱歉…我說清楚了

193
00:12:40,19 --> 00:12:42,82
Which we can celebrate later.
那我們待會兒再慶祝

194
00:12:43,46 --> 00:12:45,52
Celebrate. Celebrate....
慶祝…

195
00:12:46,66 --> 00:12:48,49
He was a double,double
他是個雙雙雙

196
00:12:48,70 --> 00:12:51,63
Double-jointed boy
雙關節男孩

197
00:12:53,37 --> 00:12:57,33
So are you the professional guitar player?
你就是那個專業的吉他手嗎？

198
00:12:57,87 --> 00:12:59,40
Yeah,I'm Stephanie.
對，我叫黛芬

199
00:13:00,07 --> 00:13:03,91
Right. My name was on there, but now it just says carrot cake.
對，上面本來有我名字的 現在只剩紅蘿蔔糕了

200
00:13:06,65 --> 00:13:09,31
So how many chords do you know?
你會彈幾個和弦？

201
00:13:09,98 --> 00:13:12,35
-All of them. -So you know D?
全都會啊 是嗎？那你會D調

202
00:13:14,49 --> 00:13:15,65
Do you know A-minor?
那你會A小調嗎？

203
00:13:18,76 --> 00:13:21,32
Do you know how to go from D to A-minor?
你會從D和弦轉到A小調嗎？

204
00:13:25,67 --> 00:13:28,50
So does your guitar have a strap?
那你的吉他有背帶嗎？

205
00:13:31,57 --> 00:13:32,70
Mine does.
我的有

206
00:13:36,51 --> 00:13:38,67
Stephanie knows all the chords
黛芬什麼和弦都會

207
00:13:41,28 --> 00:13:43,08
Come on! Pick up,pick up!
快接…

208
00:13:44,79 --> 00:13:46,41
Transit Authority?
運輸中心嗎？

209
00:13:47,22 --> 00:13:48,88
I'm doing research for a book.
我在幫一本書做調查

210
00:13:49,09 --> 00:13:53,72
I was wondering what somebody might do if they left a baby on a city bus.
如果有人把嬰兒留在市公車上 那該怎麼辦呢？

211
00:13:55,06 --> 00:13:57,72
Yes,I realize that would be a stupid character.
是，我知道 只有笨蛋才會這麼做

212
00:13:57,93 --> 00:14:00,56
Here's the deal: We lost a car seat on a bus.
我們今天在公車上 掉了汽車安全座椅

213
00:14:00,77 --> 00:14:04,20
It's white plastic and it fits onto a stroller.
白塑膠材質 有把手，可以用在推車上面

214
00:14:04,41 --> 00:14:06,24
And there was a baby in it.
裡面還有一個嬰兒

215
00:14:07,61 --> 00:14:08,87
He wants to talk to you.
他要跟你講

216
00:14:10,88 --> 00:14:14,21
Everybody,let's give a warm Central Perk welcome to
各位 我們以最熱烈的掌聲歡迎…

217
00:14:14,42 --> 00:14:17,25
Terry's a jerk And he won't let me work
泰利是個混蛋 他不讓我工作

218
00:14:17,45 --> 00:14:19,39
And I hate Central Perk
我恨中央咖啡園

219
00:14:24,06 --> 00:14:26,49
To Stephanie Schiffer!
歡迎史黛芬

220
00:14:31,60 --> 00:14:36,06
I'd like to start with a song I wrote for the first man I ever loved.
首先我想唱一首 我為我的初戀情人寫的歌

221
00:14:39,44 --> 00:14:40,57
Zachary
柴克力…

222
00:14:41,14 --> 00:14:43,94
Are all invited to bite me
被邀來咬我

223
00:14:53,42 --> 00:14:56,75
We're the guys that called about the baby! Is he here?!
我們打過電話來公車上的嬰兒 怎麼樣了？到了沒有…

224
00:14:57,63 --> 00:14:59,18
He's here.
到了

225
00:15:01,80 --> 00:15:03,35
I assume one of you is the father.
你們之中有一個是父親吧

226
00:15:03,63 --> 00:15:05,10
-That's me. -I'm him.
是我 是我

227
00:15:07,70 --> 00:15:11,93
Actually,we're both the father.
事實上呢，我們兩個都是

228
00:15:20,85 --> 00:15:23,32
Oh,Ben! Hey,buddy.
寶貝…

229
00:15:29,72 --> 00:15:32,19
Please tell me you know which one is our baby.
你知道哪個是班嗎？

230
00:15:33,83 --> 00:15:36,80
That one has ducks on his T-shirt and this one has clowns.
那個T恤上有鴨子 這個有小丑

231
00:15:37,00 --> 00:15:39,06
And Ben was definitely wearing ducks.
班絕對是穿著鴨子T恤的

232
00:15:39,30 --> 00:15:40,96
Or clowns.
或小丑

233
00:15:42,80 --> 00:15:47,17
That one's Ben! Remember he had that cute little mole by his mouth!
等一下，那個絕對是班 記得他嘴邊那顆可愛的小痣

234
00:15:47,64 --> 00:15:50,30
Hey,Ben! Remember us?
班，記得我們嗎？

235
00:15:51,08 --> 00:15:53,05
Okay,the mole came off.
天啊，痣掉了

236
00:15:54,38 --> 00:15:56,47
What are we gonna do?
我們該怎麼辦？

237
00:15:57,69 --> 00:15:59,52
We'll flip for it. Ducks or clowns.
丟銅板決定，鴨或小丑

238
00:15:59,72 --> 00:16:01,85
-Flip for the baby? -You got a better idea?
要丟銅板決定 你有更好的主意嗎？

239
00:16:02,16 --> 00:16:04,06
All right,call it in the air.
好吧，在空中叫

240
00:16:05,56 --> 00:16:06,65
Heads.
頭

241
00:16:06,86 --> 00:16:08,09
Heads,it is.
就是頭

242
00:16:11,10 --> 00:16:13,90
We have to assign heads to something!
我們得決定頭是哪一個

243
00:16:15,00 --> 00:16:16,37
Right!
好的！

244
00:16:19,11 --> 00:16:22,84
Ducks is heads because ducks have heads.
鴨子是頭，因為鴨子有頭

245
00:16:27,41 --> 00:16:30,75
What kind of scary-ass clowns came to your birthday?
幫你慶祝生日的小丑沒有頭 不會嚇壞你嗎？

246
00:16:37,76 --> 00:16:42,13
Just call me angel Of the morning,angel
叫我清晨天使

247
00:16:42,36 --> 00:16:47,10
Just touch my cheek Before you leave me,baby
在離開我之前 輕觸我的臉頰

248
00:16:47,30 --> 00:16:50,43
Just call me angel Of the morning,angel
叫我清晨天使

249
00:16:52,11 --> 00:16:55,23
Then slowly turn away
然後轉身離去

250
00:16:56,98 --> 00:17:00,38
I won't beg you to stay
我不會求你留下來

251
00:17:01,05 --> 00:17:03,48
With me
陪我

252
00:17:13,76 --> 00:17:16,46
Here. I thought you might be cold.
來，我想你可能會冷

253
00:17:16,66 --> 00:17:17,89
Thank you.
謝謝

254
00:17:25,44 --> 00:17:27,24
Look at you! You did pretty well.
看看你，幹得不錯嘛

255
00:17:28,08 --> 00:17:30,67
$8. 27.
這裡一共是八塊又二十七分

256
00:17:31,18 --> 00:17:33,58
But not really,because I put in the first two.
其實沒那麼多啦 頭兩塊是我放的

257
00:17:34,98 --> 00:17:39,18
Just to get the ball rolling and to make myself feel better.
只是讓錢滾滾來 還有讓自己舒服一點

258
00:17:39,75 --> 00:17:40,85
Do you?
結果呢？

259
00:17:42,79 --> 00:17:46,49
You know,this whole playing for money thing is so not good for me.
為了錢演奏這碼子事 對我非常的不好

260
00:17:47,59 --> 00:17:50,69
I don't know,when l sang "Su-su-suicide"...
我不知道 當我唱到「自殺」…

261
00:17:52,10 --> 00:17:55,66
... I got,like,$ 1. 75.
…我得到一塊七十五分錢

262
00:17:56,14 --> 00:17:57,97
But then "Smelly Cat"?
可是「臭臭貓」呢？

263
00:17:59,84 --> 00:18:02,71
I got 25 cents and a condom.
二十五分錢跟一個保險套

264
00:18:04,21 --> 00:18:07,94
So,you know,now I just feel really bad for "Smelly Cat."
所以現在我為「臭臭貓」 感到很難過

265
00:18:10,55 --> 00:18:14,65
Honey,I don't think everybody gets "Smelly Cat."
我不認為 大家都會懂「臭臭貓」啊

266
00:18:14,86 --> 00:18:19,79
I mean,if all you've ever actually had are healthy pets,then whoosh!
我是說 如果你只要養過健康的貓的話

267
00:18:21,90 --> 00:18:24,23
But it's not even that,you know?
可是根本就不是那個嘛

268
00:18:24,47 --> 00:18:27,30
I used to do my songs because it made me happy.
本來我唱歌只是因為我很高興

269
00:18:27,50 --> 00:18:31,40
Now it's just all about the money,you know?
可是現在卻變成全都是為了錢

270
00:18:34,07 --> 00:18:36,24
Well,people missed you in there.
菲比，大家都很想你

271
00:18:36,51 --> 00:18:39,64
In fact,there was actually a request for "Smelly Cat."
事實上 還有人指名要聽「臭臭貓」呢

272
00:18:40,05 --> 00:18:41,51
Really? From who?
真的啊？是誰呢？

273
00:18:42,08 --> 00:18:43,34
Well,me.
我啊，就是我

274
00:18:45,09 --> 00:18:49,22
And I know it's not your big money song,but it's my favorite.
我知道那不是賺大錢的歌 但我最喜歡的就是那首

275
00:18:53,09 --> 00:18:56,93
Did I accidentally drop a condom in your case?
我是不是 不小心丟了一個保險套啊？

276
00:19:00,70 --> 00:19:02,83
It's kind of an emergency.
情況緊急嘛

277
00:19:04,07 --> 00:19:05,54
-Here you go. -Thanks a lot.
拿去吧 謝了

278
00:19:05,77 --> 00:19:08,00
Hey,Christine! I got it!
克麗絲，拿到了

279
00:19:14,28 --> 00:19:17,18
I want to thank you for being there for me.
我只是想要謝謝你今天的幫忙

280
00:19:17,38 --> 00:19:19,72
And I'm sorry I almost broke your hand.
對不起，我差點捏斷你的手

281
00:19:19,92 --> 00:19:23,69
That's okay. I'm sorry I poisoned you.
沒關係，抱歉你中了我的毒

282
00:19:24,69 --> 00:19:27,89
Remember the time I jammed that pencil into your hand?
你還記得 我用鉛筆戳你的手那回嗎？

283
00:19:28,26 --> 00:19:32,46
Remember it? What do you think this is,a freckle?
記得嗎？ 你以為這是什麼？雀斑啊

284
00:19:33,53 --> 00:19:37,30
What about the time I hit you in the face with Sylvian's pumpkin?
等等，那我用薇恩的南瓜 打你臉那一次呢？

285
00:19:37,57 --> 00:19:40,10
Remember when I stuck that broom in your spokes...
天啊，記得我把掃把 插進你腳踏車輪裡…

286
00:19:40,37 --> 00:19:42,60
...and you hit your head on the curb?
結果你翻車頭撞到路邊那次嗎

287
00:19:44,28 --> 00:19:46,61
But I remember people telling me about it.
不，我記得 是別人告訴我那件事

288
00:19:48,45 --> 00:19:50,44
I hope Ben has a little sister.
我希望班有個小妹妹

289
00:19:52,25 --> 00:19:54,22
And I hope she can kick his ass.
希望她能夠好好的整整他

290
00:19:55,79 --> 00:19:57,62
I'm gonna get a new Band-Aid.
我去拿一個新的繃帶

291
00:19:58,63 --> 00:20:01,49
How about the time I cut the legs off your Malibu Ken?
我切下 你馬裡布肯娃娃的腿那次呢？

292
00:20:02,30 --> 00:20:03,59
That was you?
是你幹的啊？

293
00:20:06,17 --> 00:20:09,26
They were infected. He wouldn't have made it.
對，它的腿發炎了 不切的話它會死

294
00:20:13,41 --> 00:20:14,77
My little nephew.
我的小姪子

295
00:20:14,98 --> 00:20:16,64
Come here,little one!
過來，小東西

296
00:20:17,44 --> 00:20:21,40
There's my little baby,Ben!
我的小寶貝班班

297
00:20:25,35 --> 00:20:27,68
Hey,he's not crying!
他居然沒有哭

298
00:20:31,49 --> 00:20:33,93
Hey,he's not crying!
他沒哭呀

299
00:20:39,93 --> 00:20:42,03
There's still pie!
還有餡餅

300
00:20:42,97 --> 00:20:45,20
I'm here. I'm here.
我在，我在

301
00:20:45,94 --> 00:20:47,93
How's my little boy?
我的小寶貝好嗎？

302
00:20:48,38 --> 00:20:52,51
You want Daddy to change your diaper? I know,I know.
要爸爸幫你換尿布，對不對？ 我知道…

303
00:20:53,38 --> 00:20:57,61
Did you have fun with Uncle Joey and Uncle Chandler today?
你今天跟喬伊叔叔 還有錢德叔叔玩得開心嗎？

304
00:20:58,19 --> 00:21:00,65
He rode the bus today.
開心，他今天坐公車了

305
00:21:04,32 --> 00:21:07,05
Big boy riding the bus
好耶，大男生坐公車喔

306
00:21:08,00 --> 00:21:09,79
Hey,I have a question.
我有個問題耶

307
00:21:12,37 --> 00:21:15,39
How come it says, "Property of Human Services"?
他的小屁股上為什麼會有 「服務處財產」這些字？

308
00:21:20,41 --> 00:21:22,90
You are gonna love this.
你一定會覺得很精采的

309
00:21:23,74 --> 00:21:25,23
Can you hold Ben for a sec?
幫我抱一下班，好嗎？

310
00:21:26,15 --> 00:21:27,08
Come here. Come here.
過來…

311
00:21:27,35 --> 00:21:30,41
Stay back! I've got kiwi! Run,Joey,run!
別過來，我有奇異果 跑呀，喬伊

312
00:21:36,16 --> 00:21:39,49
Smelly cat,smelly cat
臭臭貓…

313
00:21:39,73 --> 00:21:41,82
What are they feeding you?
你都吃些什麼啊？

314
00:21:42,63 --> 00:21:43,62
No,no. I'm sorry,it's:
不對…對不起

315
00:21:43,83 --> 00:21:46,99
Smelly cat,smelly cat
臭臭貓…

316
00:21:51,41 --> 00:21:55,10
Smelly cat,smelly cat
臭臭貓…

317
00:21:55,74 --> 00:21:56,77
Better!
好一點了

318
00:21:56,98 --> 00:21:58,07
Much better. Good.
好多了

319
00:21:58,28 --> 00:22:00,94
Don't feel bad, because it's a hard song.
你知道嗎？不要難過 這首歌本來就很難

320
00:22:03,18 --> 00:22:05,58
-You want to try it again? -From the top?
要不要再試一次？ 好，從頭

321
00:22:05,79 --> 00:22:08,41
There is no "top," all right?
這次沒有頭，好嗎？

322
00:22:09,09 --> 00:22:11,18
That's the beauty of "Smelly Cat."
那是「臭臭貓」的美妙之處

323
00:22:14,46 --> 00:22:16,33
Why don't you just follow me.
你跟著我唱好了 好

324
00:22:17,50 --> 00:22:21,09
Smelly cat,smelly cat
臭臭貓…

325
00:22:21,34 --> 00:22:24,13
What are they feeding you?
他們餵你什麼？

326
00:22:24,71 --> 00:22:27,83
Smelly cat,smelly cat
臭臭貓，臭臭貓

327
00:22:28,04 --> 00:22:31,14
It's not your fault
不是你的錯

328
00:22:31,95 --> 00:22:34,28
That's too much. Sorry.
太誇張了，對不起

329
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


